<p>
  Hi <%= @check.recipient_name %>,
</p>

<p>
  <%= @check.event.name %> has just stopped a
  <%= render_money(@check.amount) %> check sent to you for
  <i>"<%= @check.payment_for %>"</i>.
</p>

<p>
  Check #<%= @check.check_number %> is no longer valid and cannot be deposited. You may still receive it in the mail; however, this check can be disposed of safely.
</p>

<p>
  If you have any questions about why this check was stopped, please contact <%= @check.event.name %>.
</p>

<p>
  Sincerely,
  <br><br>
  The Fuime Team
</p>

<%# Fuime: removed "<org> is fiscally sponsored by The Hack Foundation (d.b.a. Hack Club), a 501(c)(3) nonprofit (EIN: 81-2908499)." Fuime ventures are for-profit businesses with no fiscal sponsor; the sentence asserted a relationship that does not exist and quoted another organisation's EIN as ours. BRAND_STRINGS.md category 3 — no true Fuime version exists, so it is removed rather than reworded. %>
